Description: Renders the Rd documentation of an R package as plain
    'Markdown': one file per topic, an index, and one file with the full
    reference. The output reads well on 'GitHub' and works as context for a
    large language model. It reads an installed package with
    tools::Rd_db(), or a source package from its man/*.Rd files without
    installation.
